        "code": "def longest_window_at_most_k(packets, k):\n    if k == 0:\n        return 0\n    n = len(packets)\n    max_len = 0\n    for i in range(n):\n        seen = set()\n        for j in range(i, n):\n            seen.add(packets[j])\n            if len(seen) <= k:\n                max_len = max(max_len, j - i + 1)\n            else:\n                break\n    return max_len",
